{"script":"s_4_4_1","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]啊，是的！你们把那些角布林消灭掉以后，车队很快就到了。不过……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]你怎么还是这副愁苦的样子，问题不是都已经解决了吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]那当然是没有解决啊！因为乐器都被弄坏了啊！咳咳……要沉稳，要优雅。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]虽然乐器是来了，但由于这些角布林之前把乐器拿出来蹂躏了一番。导致很多乐器都遭到了损坏，有些乐器甚至都无法使用了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]就拿我们特意定制的森林鼓来说，那鼓膜被硬生生捅穿了好几个窟窿。还有那竖琴，上面的琴弦竟被打成了死死的结，完全没法再使用了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]长笛倒没怎么遭罪，还能用，就是上面糊满了角布林的口水，一股子怪味儿，还黏糊糊的，甚至都能拉出丝来……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]实在是太可恶啦！这群不知天高地厚的魔物，竟敢如此糟蹋这些优雅的乐器！简直不成体统，简直不可饶恕！呃、咳咳……我、我一时失态。要沉稳……要优雅……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2h","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]所以……现在你打算怎么办？乐器好不容易追回来了，总不能在这个时候取消掉演出吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2k","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]事到如今，当然是不能放弃的了，表演自然还是会举办的。现在只能想办法把这些乐器修理好了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]我手上虽然有一些可以修复的材料，不过就看这批乐器的损坏程度来看，这些材料还是远远不够的。可能还得再拜托你们……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没关系，这点小事不算什么。还需要啥？我们替你找过来。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]从现在这个情况来看……大概还需要 1 个木板和 1 份亚麻，这些应该就够了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]1 个木板和 1 份亚麻……好咧！交给我们吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"音乐家奥斯帕克","text":"[show]非常感谢！时间不多了，希望你们能快点找到！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2b","layer":"chara2","x":340,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"bright":0.6,"noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"addImg":"","layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"scaleX":1.5,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"bgblack","scaleY":1.5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"乐器都带回来了吧？"}